  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: GuideBook_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 42e58118bc42aab4984a3ff4ed822ca5, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6565687296
    m_Localized: "\t\tGreetings, sea adventurer. Today you face a difficult challenge
      \u2014 surviving in the wild depths of the sea. You have only two main goals:
      eat all your enemies and don't get eaten by them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 432891523072
    m_Localized: "\tThe ocean floor has clearly defined rules of the food chain,
      where everything starts with crabs, and each subsequent link can eat the previous
      creature or its own kind. \r\n\t<u>You can only eat fish of your own species
      when they are smaller than you; and with each level of your own growth, weaker
      fish will not appear. </u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 503548768256
    m_Localized: Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4372194422784
    m_Localized: Crab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4444495835136
    m_Localized: Sea Bass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5031555788800
    m_Localized: Mackerel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5129975132160
    m_Localized: Moray Eel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5926238580736
    m_Localized: Lionfish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6334889619456
    m_Localized: Chain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6417886507008
    m_Localized: White Shark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6543585603584
    m_Localized: Tiger Shark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6639551279104
    m_Localized: Hammerhead Shark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6901120659456
    m_Localized: Tuna
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6972407050240
    m_Localized: Barracuda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46112922169344
    m_Localized: "\tDuring your exploration of the seabed, you may encounter various
      locations and objects where you can obtain effects. Use this knowledge to survive
      longer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46567152709632
    m_Localized: "\t<u>However, keep in mind that the effects are also available
      to enemies.</u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47032749813760
    m_Localized: "\tFor each level of your fish, there will be corresponding enemies
      on the map, including weaker levels, your level, and stronger levels. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48092990173184
    m_Localized: "\tBe careful when transforming into a shark, as all sharks attack
      their own kind, even those of the same level. So if you delay your meal for
      too long, somewhere in the depths of the sea, a <u><color=red>monster</color=red></u>
      will be waiting for you, having eaten all of its friends and now waiting for
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52080728895488
    m_Localized: "\tWhen it is difficult to determine whether you can defeat an enemy
      of the same level, use the \u201CEnemy Detector\u201D hints in the form of
      a red arrow above you. If you see it, Run in the opposite direction like your
      pants are on fire!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52108457439232
    m_Localized: Enemy Detector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52339894939648
    m_Localized: "\tTo control yourself, there is a joystick and an acceleration
      button, which you can press with your hands or any other aQUatTc aDaPtaTIoNs)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55301539131392
    m_Localized: "\tFor better orientation in space and detection of enemies while
      swimming in the current, it is necessary to move in a wave-like motion."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56455538962432
    m_Localized: "\tIf you have forgotten how to play, approach the crabs as closely
      as possible for a constructive dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9502929981042688
    m_Localized: "\tSome objects can restore or improve your stats."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9509788720852992
    m_Localized: "\tBefore you dive into underwater adventures, I warn you to beware
      of the underwater rebel Pufferfish and Cuttlefish!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
